      "previewText": "A team of scientists found a wooly mammoth under the ice in Siberia and used C-14 dating to determine how long ago it lived. The initial activity of C-14 is @@initialAct@@ counts per minute (cpm) per gram of carbon, and the current activity is @@currentAct@@ cpm/g. The half-life of C-14 is 5730 years. How long ago did the mammoth live? y",
